  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $3.77B (+1.3% 30D) keeps the lane in a holding pattern\u2014liquidity and platform concentration still dominate.</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks.</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-24-blackrock-opens-tokenized-money-market-fund-with-100-million-in-assets-to-hong-kong-investors-445524\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BlackRock opens tokenized money market fund with $100 million in assets to Hong Kong investors</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/23/fidelity-investments-strive-etoro-join-okx-ice-tokenized-securities-venue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fidelity Investments, Strive, Etoro join OKX-ICE tokenized securities venue</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
